<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Odwalla Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Odwalla Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist Thursday cut its rating on Odwalla Inc to a hold from a buy following the company's decision to recall all of its apple-based juices.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, officials in Washington state said they traced 10 of 13 food poisioning cases to Odwalla juice.</p>
<p>-- H&amp;Q said publicity surrounding the recall could hurt sales.</p>
<p>-- Odwalla was down 4-5/8 to 13-3/4.</p>
</text>
